[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3363.349, "timestamp": "00:56:03", "text": "更新？我保证会在那里。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3364.87, "timestamp": "00:56:04", "text": "动画组设置将被清理"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3366.39, "timestamp": "00:56:06", "text": "稍微向上移动一点。你不会在那里看到这种情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3368.309, "timestamp": "00:56:08", "text": "从你打开它的时候开始，如果你我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3370.549, "timestamp": "00:56:10", "text": "试图更好地解释哪个范围的用户界面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3372.549, "timestamp": "00:56:12", "text": "带有图标，或许用节目形式会更好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3375.91, "timestamp": "00:56:15", "text": "目前，关键帧 UI 就是这样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3379.75, "timestamp": "00:56:19", "text": "同样的界面，哦，他们也有添加关键帧的功能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3390.47, "timestamp": "00:56:30", "text": "他们正在添加帧关键帧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3393.109, "timestamp": "00:56:33", "text": "你知道，在 Web Studio 上制作动画需要用到什么技术？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3395.99, "timestamp": "00:56:35", "text": "我现在可以制作很多疯狂的动画了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3401.47, "timestamp": "00:56:41", "text": "最后。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3404.43, "timestamp": "00:56:44", "text": "耶。我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3407.51, "timestamp": "00:56:47", "text": "去。还有，现在12点了。我该去吃饭了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3409.349, "timestamp": "00:56:49", "text": "休息，呃，不是早餐。我想念我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3411.87, "timestamp": "00:56:51", "text": "早餐。我应该去吃我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3414.309, "timestamp": "00:56:54", "text": "午餐。是的。是的。是的。我应该去吃饭了"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3416.231, "timestamp": "00:56:56", "author": "@AerinViolet", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/UKawanVvntNiAwz6RWv6wPk_S8YwApvPcCfLApO-du_RbQRIPGtzJ5FTt1DCNmZFJWc_2vxlqw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "afternoon joqUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/ssIfY7OFG5OykQOpn4CQCw"}]